NOTES: (1) updates/security pocket debs (python2.7 2.7.12, openjdk 8u191) could not be fetched here because security.ubuntu.com is blocked by this sandbox's egress policy; archive.ubuntu.com 'updates' pool paths returned 404/405 for them. On a normal machine apt would fetch them. (2) apt through this sandbox proxy returned 405 for some index files; debs were fetched with curl from the release pool and installed offline. (3) java's package scripts need /proc mounted inside the chroot.
